                                "sense_id": "a0a433b4-5268-330b-b205-4e40a2aafe8b",
                                "text": "There was a neat hat-and-umbrella stand, and the stranger's weary feet fell soft on a good, serviceable dark-red drugget, which matched in colour the flock-paper on the walls."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c1977131-900f-470a-b7b5-00af02327c6a",
                                "sense_id": "a0a433b4-5268-330b-b205-4e40a2aafe8b",
                                "text": "Just under the ceiling there were three lunette windows, heavily barred and blacked out in the normal way by centuries of grime. Their bases were on a level with the pavement outside, a narrow way which was several feet lower than the road behind the house."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
